   '[{"question": "What is the Foo workout?", "answer": "13 bench presses for time, then as many rounds and reps as possible in 20 minutes of 7 chest-to-bar pull-ups, 77 double-unders, 2 squat clean thrusters and 28 sit-ups. The barbell is 170 lb / 110 lb."}, {"question": "How many reps are in one round of Foo?", "answer": "114 reps: 7 chest-to-bar pull-ups, 77 double-unders, 2 squat clean thrusters and 28 sit-ups."}, {"question": "Who was Foo?", "answer": "Sgt. Gary \"Foo\" Morales, 35, an Air Force veteran with the St. Lucie County Sheriff''s Office in Florida. He was shot and killed during a traffic stop on Feb. 28, 2013."}, {"question": "Does the 20 minutes include the bench presses?", "answer": "CrossFit does not say. You can start the 20-minute clock after the bench presses or include them in it. Note which one you chose so you can compare your scores."}]'::jsonb,
