   '[{"question": "What is the Fournier workout?", "answer": "For time: 50 shoulder-to-overheads (115 lb / 75 lb), 50 ft arm-over-arm sled pull, 40 burpees, 50 ft sled pull, 30 sumo deadlift high pulls (85 lb / 55 lb), 50 ft sled pull."}, {"question": "How heavy should the sled be?", "answer": "CrossFit does not give a load. It says to use a load that is challenging but does not need long rests."}, {"question": "Who was Fournier?", "answer": "Mike Fournier, 52, a helicopter pilot and CrossFit Level 2 Trainer. He died on Aug. 19, 2020, when his helicopter crashed while fighting the Hills Fire near Coalinga, California."}, {"question": "What is an arm-over-arm sled pull?", "answer": "You stand in place holding a rope tied to a sled and pull it toward you hand over hand until it reaches you."}]'::jsonb,
