   'rounds_reps',
   'Gale Force honors Devyn Gale, 19, of the British Columbia Wildfire Service. She was killed on July 13, 2023, when a tree struck her while her crew cut a perimeter around a fire outside Revelstoke, British Columbia. Gale was studying to be a nurse, trained at Mountain Made CrossFit and liked to walk hills with a backpack full of textbooks.

You get 30 minutes to complete as many rounds as you can of 20 box step-ups wearing a backpack (50 lb / 35 lb, 24 in / 20 in box), 23 burpees over the backpack and 19 air squats. When the clock ends, the group does one more set of 19 squats together. The backpack stays on for the step-ups, so your legs carry the load for the full 30 minutes.',
   '[{"name": "Box Step-Ups", "reps": "20", "tip": "Wear the backpack. Stand all the way up on the box and alternate legs.", "rx_men": "50 lb backpack, 24 in", "rx_women": "35 lb backpack, 20 in"}, {"name": "Burpees Over Backpack", "reps": "23", "tip": "Take the pack off, do a burpee beside it, then jump over it. Find a steady rhythm."}, {"name": "Air Squats", "reps": "19", "tip": "Hips below the knees and stand all the way up."}, {"name": "Air Squats", "reps": "19 (after the clock)", "tip": "When the 30 minutes end, do one more set of 19 squats together as a group."}]'::jsonb,
   'Score is total rounds + reps in 30 minutes. CrossFit does not say whether the final group set of 19 squats counts. It comes after the clock, so record your score at 30 minutes and note whether you added it.',
   '["Pack the backpack so it does not bounce", "Find a burpee pace you can hold for 30 minutes", "Save a little for the group squats"]'::jsonb,
   '["Pack the weight tight and high in the backpack, and pull the straps snug so it does not shift on the step-ups.", "Drive through the heel of the foot on the box and stand fully before you step down.", "Put the backpack down in the same spot every round so your burpees start without thinking.", "Aim for even rounds. Check your split at 10 and 20 minutes.", "Use the air squats to bring your breathing down before the next set of step-ups."]'::jsonb,
   'Lighten the backpack or step up without it, and use a lower box. Replace the burpees over the backpack with burpees beside it, or step back and step up instead of jumping. Air squats can go to a box or bench behind you.',
   '[{"question": "What is the Gale Force workout?", "answer": "As many rounds and reps as possible in 30 minutes of 20 box step-ups with a backpack (50 lb / 35 lb, 24 in / 20 in box), 23 burpees over the backpack and 19 air squats. After the clock, the group does 19 squats together."}, {"question": "How many reps are in one round of Gale Force?", "answer": "62 reps: 20 step-ups, 23 burpees and 19 air squats."}, {"question": "Who was Gale Force?", "answer": "Devyn Gale, 19, of the British Columbia Wildfire Service. She was killed on July 13, 2023, when a tree struck her while fighting a wildfire outside Revelstoke, British Columbia."}, {"question": "Do I wear the backpack for the burpees and squats?", "answer": "CrossFit says to wear the backpack for the step-ups and to do the burpees over it. It does not say to wear it for the air squats."}]'::jsonb,
