   'Gavin honors Lt. Col. Ryan Edward Gavin, 45, of Clayton, North Carolina, who died on March 3, 2026. His family said his death by suicide was directly related to his military service. A 2002 graduate of the U.S. Military Academy, he served 20 years as an armor officer, including two combat tours in Iraq, and earned the Bronze Star Medal twice. He trained at CrossFit Clayton for 13 years, and Murph was his favorite workout.

You complete 20 rounds of 5 pull-ups, 10 push-ups, 15 air squats and a 200 m run while wearing a vest (20 lb / 14 lb). That adds up to 100 pull-ups, 200 push-ups, 300 squats and 4,000 m of running, the same reps as Murph''s middle section, now split by short runs.

If you or someone you know is struggling, call or text 988 (Veterans: press 1).',
   '[{"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "5", "tip": "Chin over the bar. Keep these unbroken if you can.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Chest to the floor and full lockout. Break into 5 and 5 when you tire.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Air Squats", "reps": "15", "tip": "Hips below the knees and stand all the way up.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "200 m", "tip": "Steady pace. Use the run to recover for the next round.", "rx_men": "20 lb vest", "rx_women": "14 lb vest"}]'::jsonb,
