   'time',
   'Gaza honors U.S. Air Force Capt. Lucas "Gaza" Gruenther, 32, of Twain Harte, California, chief of flight safety for the 31st Fighter Wing at Aviano, Italy. He died on Jan. 28, 2013, when his F-16 went down in bad weather over the Adriatic Sea off the coast of Italy.

You complete five rounds of 35 kettlebell swings (53 lb / 35 lb), 30 push-ups, 25 pull-ups, 20 box jumps (30 in / 24 in) and a 1 mile run. That adds up to 175 swings, 150 push-ups, 125 pull-ups, 100 box jumps and 5 miles of running. This is a long workout, so pacing matters from the first round.',
   '[{"name": "Kettlebell Swings", "reps": "35", "tip": "Drive with your hips and finish with the bell overhead. Break into sets before your grip fails.", "rx_men": "53 lb", "rx_women": "35 lb"}, {"name": "Push-Ups", "reps": "30", "tip": "Chest to the floor and full lockout. Break into small sets early."}, {"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "25", "tip": "Chin over the bar. Small sets save your grip for later rounds."}, {"name": "Box Jumps", "reps": "20", "tip": "Stand all the way up on the box. Step down to save your legs for the run.", "rx_men": "30 in", "rx_women": "24 in"}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "1 mile", "tip": "Settle into a steady pace you can repeat five times."}]'::jsonb,
